# Implementation Plan - UI and Component Standardization

Standardize the user interface across the `inaagapay_flutter_v2` project by aligning headers, input values, dropdown fields, modal CTA buttons, and search bars to achieve modern, pill-shaped, premium visual styles and functional consistency.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> Review the styling tokens and proposed custom component interfaces to ensure they match expectations. We are maintaining context-aware dynamic light/dark values for maximum accessibility.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - `SecondaryHeader` will directly implement `PreferredSizeWidget`. This makes `appBar: SecondaryHeader(...)` much cleaner, while leaving all existing manual `PreferredSize` wrapper calls backwards-compatible.
> - Dropdowns will be converted from `DropdownButton` / `DropdownButtonFormField` to the search-supported Material 3 `DropdownMenu` to satisfy the "drop-below and searchable" typing design.

